WEBVTT

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.040
Where am I?

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:17.900
Now I remember. Gilag did this.

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:21.000
The power of these bindings...

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:24.500
They're Don Thousand's power. Why did Gilag...

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:28.780
Defeat us and take our powers and souls?!

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:30.800
Merag! Durbe!

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.280
Do you honestly believe something like that is possible?!

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:36.590
Why yes, yes I do! You see, I've...

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:40.960
... brought Don Thousand back within my body!

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:42.560
What?!

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:50.140
Th-that's!

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:55.020
My name is Don Thousand! Creator of the Barian World!

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:59.080
Vector's the one who revived Don Thousand?!

00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:02.140
My servants, the time has come.

00:01:02.140 --> 00:01:06.340
Now is when you shall become sustenance for my power!

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:10.820
Why? If you are truly the Barian god, why do you need us?!

00:01:11.290 --> 00:01:14.280
That is because it is your destinies.

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:19.200
The souls chosen to provide sustenance for my revival.

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:21.600
That is the purpose of  Seven Lords.

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:25.140
Us Seven Lords?!

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:27.500
That can't be! That means we're...

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:33.300
That's right! You were always just a snack for Don Thousand!

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:36.420
You're also one of the Seven Lords! You're also-

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:41.160
See that's where you're wrong! I've become one with Don Thousand!

00:01:41.820 --> 00:01:45.000
I am... A GOD!!!

00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:56.740
Power! Power surging through me!

00:01:57.050 --> 00:02:01.600
Vector... Has he really taken in Don Thousand's power...?

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:05.140
Merag, get out of here and leave this to me!

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:06.980
But Durbe!

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:09.860
You have to tell the others about this!

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:11.640
The <i>others</i>?

00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:14.360
You haven't noticed?

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:20.260
Ever since Alito and Gilag awoke, they've been my hands and feet, you know~

00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:21.940
It can't be!

00:02:22.260 --> 00:02:26.320
Of course, Alito already lost to Yuma and Astral and woke up, but~

00:02:26.320 --> 00:02:27.600
What did you say?!

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:30.340
Yuuuma and Astral are headed this way~!

00:02:30.630 --> 00:02:34.920
Maybe he's holding hands with that traitor Alito, eh~?

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:37.940
But we still have Nasch!

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:39.700
Oh you wish.

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:45.760
Anyways now! I'm going to swallow you two right here!

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:47.840
There's no escape!

00:02:48.620 --> 00:02:52.320
In order to beat Vector as he is, we're going to have to join forces.

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:54.340
It looks like you're right.

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:59.040
If we don't want to get devoured, I suppose there's no choice but to defeat you!

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:03.720
In that case, there's no choice!

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:21.120
Duel!

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:25.020
That's...!

00:03:26.690 --> 00:03:30.560
That's a dimensional rift. The Barian World is just past it.

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:32.520
It's just ahead...

00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:36.510
{marker}

00:03:36.510 --> 00:03:40.690
WONDER WINGS, will you carry me...

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:45.930
...to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF!

00:03:53.510 --> 00:03:57.620
The Duel that decides our fate,

00:03:57.980 --> 00:04:01.800
now, show me your [Heart] CARD

00:04:04.560 --> 00:04:08.620
Words aren't enough to satisfy

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:12.600
the feelings I want to express.

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:21.620
Beside you, I've always been dreaming the same

00:04:22.180 --> 00:04:24.870
Right now, with you

00:04:25.020 --> 00:04:28.800
Oh - By facing each other,

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:35.880
... to create a new future, let's Shining Draw!

00:04:36.860 --> 00:04:40.980
On WONDER WINGS, you carry me...

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:46.410
... don't let us ever untie our hands,

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:51.580
<i>Kattobing</i> from the sun...

00:04:52.480 --> 00:05:01.160
... on to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF TO THE FUTURE!

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:09.910
Let's make this duel a Battle Royale, agreed?

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:16.170
Right then! My turn! Draw!

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:20.880
<i>Vector's Scorn! The Sundered Seven Lords!</i>

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:21.380
It's here! The card we've been waiting for~

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:25.470
I'll activate the Continuous Spell, Don Thousand's Throne!

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:34.600
Now, while I'd like to just kick back and relax on this here throne,

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:37.350
I suppose that'd be rude, wouldn't it?

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:42.780
So that's why~ I'm going to equip myself with Don Thousand's Throne!

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:56.330
That asshole.

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:57.920
What is he planning?

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:00.210
What the-

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:03.090
This feeling's...

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:07.090
I'll summon two Umbral Ghosts from my hand!

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:10.890
If I have two copies of this same card in my hand,

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:13.350
I can Special Summon both of them to the field!

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:17.640
Next I'll summon Umbral Will O' the Wisp!

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:20.350
When this card is summoned,

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:23.690
It's level becomes the same as a monster on my field.

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:28.650
I'll make it Level 2 just like my fabulous Ghosts!

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:35.410
I'll Overlay my two Level 2 Umbral Ghosts and my Umbral Will O' the Wisp!

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:38.040
Xyz Summon!

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:43.000
Come forth Number 96!

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:47.380
Envoy of the pitch black darkness, Black Mist!

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:51.640
Aaaand~!

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:54.350
Say, Black Mist~

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:57.390
Why don't you show them your true self~?!

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:02.480
What the-

00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:05.780
That's...!

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:09.650
Durbe, this is your first run in with him, isn't it?

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:15.330
This is the guy who buried Astral once! Number 96!

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:19.080
But weren't you allies with 96?!

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:21.670
Oh yeah~ But see,

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:25.540
After 96 and Astral took each other out,

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:29.840
What was left of his powers were all taken by me!

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:35.100
So now, he's my faithful little puppet!

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:39.270
And soon, you two will join him too.

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:43.560
I'll set one card and end my turn!

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:45.770
After all, in a Battle Royale

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:49.780
none of the players can attack on their first turn.

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:52.860
I'm never going to lose to you of all people.

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:54.450
For Nasch's sake as well!

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:56.990
My turn! Draw!

00:07:57.450 --> 00:08:00.120
I summon Blizzard Thunderbird!

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:08.050
And I'll activate the Spell Card, Blizzard Vision!

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:14.180
This card can become the same Monster as one WATER Monster you control.

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:17.300
However, its ATK becomes 0.

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:21.810
I Overlay 2 Level 4 Blizzard Thunderbirds!

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:24.100
Xyz Summon!

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:27.730
Come forth, Number 103!

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:31.190
Subzero Priestess, Ragna Zero!

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:38.410
Has the kitty come out to play?

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:41.620
I'll Set one card and end my turn.

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:45.830
Vector, witness our combined might!

00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:48.710
My turn! Draw!

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:52.050
I Summon Holy Lightning Wings!

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:56.390
When this monster is Summoned,

00:08:57.050 --> 00:09:00.810
I can Special Summon a Holy Lightning monster!

00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:04.310
Come forth, Holy Lightning Books!

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:10.480
While I have Books, once per turn, I can send one Spell Card from my hand to the Graveyard,

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:16.200
And by doing so I can Special Summon a Holy Lightning monster from my hand!

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:19.450
Come, Holy Lightning Sword!

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:26.170
I Overlay my Level 4 Holy Lightning Wings, Books, and Sword!

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:28.290
Xyz Summon!

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:32.960
Come forth, Number 102!

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:37.720
Holy Lightning, Glorious Halo!

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:41.680
I activate Glorious Halo's effect!

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:47.520
By using one Overlay Unit, I can negate the Effect of one of my opponent's monsters!

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:49.980
And also, halve its ATK!

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:58.820
Pfft. It's only a 50 ATK decrease.

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:01.740
I'll activate Ragna Zero's effect!

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:03.950
By detaching an Overlay Unit

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:08.830
when an opponent's monster's ATK becomes lower than its Original ATK,

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:11.250
I can destroy that monster!

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:12.710
What?!

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:15.710
Guidance to Funeral!

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:25.020
We're not done yet! I activate the Quick-Play Spell, Wrath of Holy Lightning!

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:29.230
If I control a Holy Lightning Monster

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:31.520
when my opponent's monster is destroyed,

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:35.150
this card inflicts 1000 damage to my opponent!

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:42.280
Well, Vector?

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:44.160
How do you like our teamwork?

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:47.790
Cute. Real cute.

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:53.000
When a monster is destroyed by Ragna Zero's effect, I can draw one card.

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:56.670
And I'll Set a card and end my tu-

00:10:56.670 --> 00:10:58.510
Hold your horses!

00:10:59.180 --> 00:11:01.970
I activate my Trap! Necro Xyz!

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:06.720
During the End Phase of a turn when my Number was destroyed,

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:10.730
by using Rank 4 or lower DARK monsters in my Graveyard as Xyz Material,

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:15.150
I can Xyz Summon a DARK Fiend-Type monster!

00:11:16.030 --> 00:11:19.200
In addition, the Levels of all monsters that I targeted

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:22.660
become the same as the required Levels for the Xyz Summon!

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:29.660
I'll Overlay the the two DARK Umbral Ghosts and my Will O' the Wisp in my Graveyard!

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:32.000
Xyz Summon!

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:36.130
Come forth Number 43!

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:44.970
The avatar of disgrace which disturbs the rest of the deceased!

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:48.720
Demonic Puppeteer of Souls, Soul Marrionetter!

00:11:49.930 --> 00:11:52.900
And when Soul Marionetter is Summoned,

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:56.610
it can equip a Number in my Graveyard!

00:11:57.270 --> 00:12:02.360
I'll equip the Number 96 in my Graveyard to Soul Marionetter!

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:08.240
Vector, just what are you planning?!

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:14.250
And now I'll activate the effect of Don Thousand's Throne!

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:17.840
At the end of a turn in which I took damage,

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:24.130
I gain Life Points equal to the damage taken!

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:31.310
Let it flow...! Gooo with the flow...!

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:40.690
Nasch, that <i>was</i>... tasty.

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:46.370
And here we activate Soul Marionetter's effect.

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:48.870
When I gain Life Points,

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:53.290
Soul Marionetter gains ATK equal to the amount I gained!

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:57.210
And then Damage equal to the Life Points I gained

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:59.500
are inflicted to the opponent!

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:05.300
Now, remember that 1000 points of damage? I think I'll return the favor...

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:06.510
... to Merag!

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:10.010
Resolute Convert!

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:17.560
Merag!

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:20.730
I- I'm fine, so far...

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:22.740
Thaaats iiit~

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:25.700
It'd be such a shame if you passed out here~

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:28.780
Gaining Life Points equal to the amount of Damage taken...

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:31.950
...and increasing his monster's ATK by the same amount...

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:36.080
And inflicting damage to one of us equal to that amount.

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:39.540
<i>And slowly draining Nasch of his energy,</i>

00:13:39.590 --> 00:13:42.170
<i>... to make him ever weaker...!</i>

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:46.880
So? What do you think of <i>my highness'</i> invincible self?

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:51.930
Unless we defeat him in one turn, we don't have a chance, do we?

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:55.140
Do you really think you can beat ME?

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:58.400
<i>Me</i>, Vector, who may as well be a GOD?

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:01.730
My turn! Draw!

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:05.940
I'll attack Glorious Halo with Soul Marionetter!

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:07.070
What?!

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:18.540
Why are you destroying your own Monster?!

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:23.880
I'll use Soul Marionetter's effect!

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:30.970
This little bad boy can't be destroyed while he's equipped with a Number!

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:32.300
What?!

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:34.350
Too bad, eh?

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:40.900
I'll also activate my Quick-Play Spell! Card of Self Torment!

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:44.610
When I take Damage,

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:47.690
this card inflicts an additional 1000 to me!

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:57.080
By the rest of Card of Self Torment's effect, I'll draw one card.

00:14:57.160 --> 00:15:01.040
And I'll set two cards and end my turn!

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:06.920
And now, the effect of Don Thousand's Throne!

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:18.390
And coming up next, the effect of Soul Marionetter!

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:21.850
Over and over, its ATK just keeps growing~!

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:27.070
And of course, you'll be taking 2500 Points of Damage!

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:31.450
Eeny meeny miny-Merag!

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:33.780
Resolute Convert!

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:40.910
Merag!

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:49.210
Bravo! Bravo! The little princess now looks like a pauper!

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:51.470
Merag!

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:55.220
Vector! Why is she taking all the pain?!

00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:04.650
Ooooh. Thaaat's it. That's the look I want!

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:07.690
All that fabulous contempt and torment~!

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:09.610
VEECTOOR!

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:12.570
Merag. You have 500 Life Points.

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:16.780
Just a little bit more, bitch, and I'll kill you for sure this time~

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:18.450
This time?

00:16:18.740 --> 00:16:22.250
Eeh? Don't tell me you still haven't remembered.

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:24.330
Remember...?

00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:27.380
Lemme remind you then!

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:30.630
We now present the shocking truth~!

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:32.800
TADAAAA~

00:16:33.590 --> 00:16:35.050
Merag~!

00:16:35.390 --> 00:16:38.510
The one who killed you and Nasch in the Barian World...

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:40.770
waaaas...YOURS TRULY!

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:53.240
<i>Give it up Vector! You're done for!</i>

00:16:54.610 --> 00:16:56.820
<i>Now. Let Merag go!</i>

00:16:57.410 --> 00:16:59.790
<i>Do so and I'll spare you your life.</i>

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:03.290
<i>Nasch! Forget about me and get him!</i>

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:06.000
<i>Are you fucking kidding?</i>

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:09.170
<i>You two really, reeeally, get on my nerves YOU KNOW THAT?!</i>

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:13.220
<i>Fine then! I'll just throw your little sister in hell!</i>

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:17.930
<i>Trap Card! Heavenly Broadsword!</i>

00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:28.310
<i>This little sucker'll kill you if you fall in.</i>

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:31.570
<i>It's a black hole that'll bury you for all eternity!</i>

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:34.280
<i>Stop it. Vector.</i>

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:36.530
<i>Shut up. Get out of my sight!</i>

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:38.160
<i>Merag!</i>

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:41.290
<i>Merag!!!</i>

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:42.660
<i>Retards.</i>

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:45.540
<i>Merag!</i>

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:46.540
<i>Merag!
Nasch!</i>

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:49.040
<i>... Can' break free...!</i>

00:17:57.720 --> 00:17:59.180
<i>At this rate we'll...</i>

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:00.300
<i>Nasch!</i>

00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:03.140
<i>What is that?</i>

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:09.980
<i>Whe- where are we?</i>

00:18:12.610 --> 00:18:16.030
<i>I have come to greet you, my lord.</i>

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:17.240
<i>And you are?</i>

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:18.530
<i>I am Abyss.</i>

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:21.740
<i>I serve you, and will save you.</i>

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:23.700
<i>Save me?</i>

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:29.920
<i>I shall move your souls to new vessels in the Human World.</i>

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:32.250
<i>Us?  As humans?</i>

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:36.670
<i>However, all of your memories will be erased.</i>

00:18:36.760 --> 00:18:41.550
<i>And when your majesty comes face to face with my lowly self once more,</i>

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:43.760
<i>those memories will be...</i>

00:18:45.270 --> 00:18:48.140
<i>Understood. I leave myself in your care, Abyss!</i>

00:18:54.150 --> 00:18:56.400
<i>Well?  Any luck with their parents?</i>

00:18:56.650 --> 00:18:59.360
<i>No good. They just passed away.</i>

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:00.450
<i>I see...</i>

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:03.700
<i>Nurse, move them to the mortuary.</i>

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:06.290
<i>After that, contact the police.</i>

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:07.200
<i>Yes sir.</i>

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:15.210
<i>Wha-what the?!</i>

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:16.420
<i>They're alive!</i>

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:18.090
<i>The kids are alive!</i>

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:21.470
Merag...

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:25.680
I...remember everything.

00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:29.640
Nasch and I were...

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:33.400
Vector, why did you do such a thing!?

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:35.980
Because I fucking hated their guts.

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:41.780
Ever since we first met, everything about Nasch just pissed me off.

00:19:42.570 --> 00:19:45.990
Everything fucking little thing he did and said pissed me off.

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:51.290
He and I just don't mix. It's fate.

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:55.540
But seriously! It's not like I didn't try!

00:19:55.540 --> 00:19:59.090
I mean, it'd be wrong to just kill him just because I despise, him right?

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:01.720
So I implemented a point system!

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:03.970
A point system?!

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:07.970
Nasch got a point when he pissed me off!

00:20:08.470 --> 00:20:11.100
And when it finally reaches a million points or so?

00:20:11.180 --> 00:20:12.440
Smash him!

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:14.980
I told myself to hold back until then.

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:18.440
A point every time he opens his loud trap.

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:22.530
And with a point every time he does something...

00:20:23.110 --> 00:20:24.780
And SUPRIIIISE!

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:28.580
We finally hit a million points!

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:31.460
...Vector...

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:36.380
But I never thought those two corpses would come back from the grave.

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:40.550
When we were reborn in human bodies...

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:45.260
We met Yuma and his friends as Kamishiro Ryoga and Rio...

00:20:45.340 --> 00:20:46.760
And forged friendships...

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:54.190
When we regained our memories as Barians and realized our destinies...

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:56.860
Do you have any idea how much Nasch suffered?!

00:20:57.480 --> 00:21:00.730
Sure do~ It was a total fun ride!

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:03.400
VEEECTOR!!!!

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:16.880
You're Gilag!

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:25.050
Nasch. Lend me your strength.

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:28.300
My turn! Draw!

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:32.850
I activate Rank-Up-Magic! The Seventh One!

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:37.480
This card turns my Over Hundred Number into Chaos,

00:21:37.650 --> 00:21:41.110
And Ranks it Up! Chaos Xyz Change!

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:48.740
Please come forth! Chaos Number 103!

00:21:50.830 --> 00:21:55.000
The unlimited power to freeze even time itself rises once again.

00:21:55.210 --> 00:21:58.330
Subzero Priestess, Ragna Infinity!

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:01.670
Vector!

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:06.050
This time, I'll let you be the one who'll disappear.

00:22:06.090 --> 00:22:08.090
I'm going to bury you in ice.

00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:10.300
{marker}

00:22:10.300 --> 00:22:11.930
In the present, past and future,

00:22:11.930 --> 00:22:16.350
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:22:16.390 --> 00:22:18.600
'Til we can grab hold of them

00:22:18.650 --> 00:22:22.270
Challenge the GAME!

00:22:24.070 --> 00:22:24.900
Let it go.

00:22:35.290 --> 00:22:38.160
When there's a problem that can't be beaten,

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:43.380
We'll just try again.

00:22:45.300 --> 00:22:49.300
You keep holding your heart inside your chest

00:22:49.300 --> 00:22:54.640
It's the power you get from keeping the faith.

00:22:54.760 --> 00:22:59.480
Even while you're discouraged and crying

00:22:59.900 --> 00:23:05.360
Let's try to secure tomorrow with our bonds

00:23:05.650 --> 00:23:07.530
We can shatter anything

00:23:07.530 --> 00:23:11.910
Fear and fate and even the most fervent fantasies

00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:15.790
Keep on burning as you break through!

00:23:15.870 --> 00:23:17.540
In the Present, Past and Future

00:23:17.620 --> 00:23:22.000
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:23:22.080 --> 00:23:24.130
Let's go and reach out

00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:26.960
Beyond the limits

00:23:27.090 --> 00:23:29.380
'Til we can grab hold of them,

00:23:29.380 --> 00:23:32.890
Challenge the GAME

00:23:40.730 --> 00:23:43.730
An enraged Merag launches wave after wave of attacks.

00:23:43.730 --> 00:23:48.400
But when Vector is pushed into a corner, he reveals a shocking revelation.

00:23:48.570 --> 00:23:51.400
Before their eyes lay an imprisoned Nasch.

00:23:51.490 --> 00:23:54.410
It can't be...We were taking Nasch's life?

00:23:54.410 --> 00:23:56.870
Gilag! You're being used!

00:23:56.990 --> 00:23:59.330
You can't lose, okay?

00:23:59.450 --> 00:24:01.870
Stop! DURBE!!!

00:24:02.000 --> 00:24:03.920
Next Time, on Yu-Gi-Oh ZEXAL II!

00:24:03.960 --> 00:24:06.840
My Body as a Shield! Durbe's Final Vow!

00:24:06.840 --> 00:24:09.210
Vector! Prepare yourself!
